#: org.scantpaper.desktop.metainfo.xml:10
msgid "GUI to produce PDFs or DjVus from scanned documents"
msgstr ""

#: org.scantpaper.desktop.metainfo.xml:12
msgid ""
"Only two clicks are required to scan several pages and then save all or a "
"selection as a PDF or DjVu file, including metadata if required."
msgstr ""

#: org.scantpaper.desktop.metainfo.xml:16
msgid ""
"scantpaper can control regular or sheet-fed (ADF) scanners with SANE via "
"libimage-sane-perl, scanimage or scanadf, and can scan multiple pages at "
"once."
msgstr ""

#: org.scantpaper.desktop.metainfo.xml:21
msgid ""
"It presents a thumbnail view of scanned pages, and permits simple operations"
" such as cropping, rotating and deleting pages."
msgstr ""

#: org.scantpaper.desktop.metainfo.xml:25
msgid ""
"OCR can be used to recognise text in the scans, and the output embedded in "
"the PDF or DjVu."
msgstr ""

#: org.scantpaper.desktop.metainfo.xml:29
msgid ""
"The resulting document may be saved as a PDF, DjVu, multipage TIFF file, or "
"single page image file."
msgstr ""

#: org.scantpaper.desktop:4
msgid "A GUI to aid the scan-to-PDF process"
msgstr ""

